   '2025-08-21', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', 'ff844faf4999e5fbee4946621c77e88472f948555798447101f509a0dc8e0892', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the 2025-08-21 date comes from the official file name and the Army G-1 listing (https://www.army.mil/g-1), checked 2026-10-16; the PDF body may print no date. Imported for 19C, 19D, 19K, 19Z. Duties and prerequisites are NOT imported from this guide (DA PAM 611-21 is the source for them); promotion-board criteria are stored but never shown. LIMITATIONS: Reserve Component chapters and professional-development-model figures are not imported; career-field-wide rank guidance is attached to every MOS of this guide that has its own chapter.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-25-cmf-19-da-pam-600-25-21-aug-25@2026-10-18', 'a0df31c2d607b7317cc7121a001a77fa81a86fc1cddcb31de2f6fc55626429f8')
