  ('de265068-cab6-58ec-b20d-729e26312bb7', 'edae8a9a-ae10-54a7-bf9b-35d57d16a550', 'Army', 'enlisted', '19D', null, 'development', 'E-6', null, 'Staff Sergeant — recommended career management (applies to every MOS in this career management field)', 'Chapter 4. Career Management by Rank CMF 19 Private-Specialist/Corporal', 'A critical link in the NCO support channel, Armor Staff Sergeants (SSG) command combat platforms or lead sections/squads. They support the Chain of Command through the NCO Support Channel. Armor Proponent desires the following KSBs for Staff Sergeants:
